## 📊 Token Economics

| Parameter | Value | Notes |
|-----------|-------|-------|
| **Token Name** | Referral Token | |
| **Symbol** | REF | |
| **Decimals** | 18 | Standard ERC-20 |
| **Reward per Swap** | 10 REF | Configurable |
| **Total Supply** | Unlimited (Mint-only) | Can be capped in future versions |

